+!!! warn
+    Some Hive Metastore versions have compatibility issues that can affect Iceberg schema-evolution
+    operations performed through the Hive engine. If a schema change (such as adding, renaming, or
+    dropping a column) fails or leaves the Hive table schema out of sync with the Iceberg table,
+    verify that your Hive Metastore version is supported (see [Global Hive catalog](#global-hive-catalog))
+    and upgrade the metastore if needed. As a workaround, perform the schema change using another
+    engine (for example, Spark or the Java API) and then refresh the Hive table metadata.
+
